Privacy Policy for APX // NIGHT

Effective Date: April 3, 2026

Data Collection: APX // NIGHT does not collect, store, or transmit any personal user data. All logs, mission data, and XP progress are stored locally on the user's device.

Biometrics: FaceID and TouchID authentication are handled entirely by the iOS system. The app does not have access to your biometric data.

Third Parties: No data is shared with third-party services.

Contact: For questions, contact us via the support link on the App Store.
